      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA SUMMIT (1) was out of the placings when fourth last time but prior to that ran a blistering 29.31 win over 515m at Sandown. Looks the one to beat on win two back. MILLY LILY (3) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (30.38). Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. GORRINGE (7) was below best at her last start when 7th at Sandown following a win (34.62) there two back. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Should be in this for a long way. MIGHTY MISS (8) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
